Subject: [PATCH] arm64: retain A16 hardware fixes after the Surface Laptop 8 series

Rebase the residual A16 changes onto the shared Linux 7.3-4 stack after
#1706. Keep the shared USB votes, LPASS Compander1 addresses, v8 eDP
calibration, LINK_RATE_SET refinements and USB4/DisplayPort lane ownership.
Retain A16 board/firmware policy and error recovery, adapting QMP resource
tracking and Type-C rollback to the shared USB4 state machine. Preserve
masked V2 altmode notifications when snapshotting events. Camera stays
disabled; native package builds and physical A16 acceptance are pending.

